an>Community support</li></ul><button class=\"w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm transition-colors bg-gray-900 text-white hover:bg-gray-700\">Get Started</button></div><div class=\"relative flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-6 border transition-shadow border-orange-400 bg-orange-50 shadow-lg shadow-orange-100\"><div class=\"absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-orange-500 text-white text-xs font-bold px-4 py-1 rounded-full\">Most Popular</div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900\">Growth</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5\">Small agencies, content + proposals</p></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-1\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900\">$<!-- -->249</span><span class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm\">/mo</span></div><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-orange-600 mt-1\">1,500 MCU / month</p></div><ul class=\"space-y-2 flex-1 mb-6\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500 text-base mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">check_circle</span>1,500 MCU / month</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500 text-base mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">check_circle</span>Everything in Starter</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500 text-base mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">check_circle</span>Video script generation</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500 text-base mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">check_circle</span>Affiliate content suite</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500 text-base mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">check_circle</span>Priority support</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500 text-base mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">check_circle</span>Usage analytics</li></ul><button class=\"w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm transition-colors bg-orange-500 text-white hover:bg-orange-600\">Get Started</button></div><div class=\"relative flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-6 border transition-shadow border-gray-200 bg-white hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900\">Premium</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5\">Growing agencies, full RaaS suite</p></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-1\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900\">$<!-- -->499</span><span class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm\">/mo</span></div><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-orange-600 mt-1\">4,000 MCU / month</p></div><ul class=\"space-y-2 flex-1 mb-6\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500 text-base mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">check_circle</span>4,000 MCU / month</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500 text-base mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">check_circle</span>Everything in Growth</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500 text-base mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">check_circle</span>HeyGen video production</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500 text-base mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">check_circle</span>Custom mission templates</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500 text-base mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">check_circle</span>CRM &amp; affiliate integrations</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500 text-base mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">check_circle</span>Dedicated support</li></ul><button class=\"w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm transition-colors bg-gray-900 text-white hover:bg-gray-700\">Get Started</button></div><div class=\"relative flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-6 border transition-shadow border-gray-200 bg-white hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"mb-4\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900\">Master</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5\">Enterprise, white-label RaaS</p></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-1\"><span class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900\">$<!-- -->999</span><span class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm\">/mo</span></div><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-orange-600 mt-1\">Unlimited MCU</p></div><ul class=\"space-y-2 flex-1 mb-6\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500 text-base mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">check_circle</span>Unlimited MCU</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500 text-base mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">check_circle</span>Everything in Premium</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500 text-base mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">check_circle</span>White-label branding</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500 text-base mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">check_circle</span>Custom LLM routing</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500 text-base mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">check_circle</span>SLA guarantee</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-orange-500 text-base mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">check_circle</span>Dedicated account manager</li></ul><button class=\"w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm transition-colors bg-gray-900 text-white hover:bg-gray-700\">Get Started</button></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 bg-white border-t border-gray-100\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 text-center mb-10\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"border-b border-gray-100 pb-6 last:border-0\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">What is an MCU?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">MCU (Mission Credit Unit) is our compute currency. 1 MCU = 1 unit of AI work. A basic proposal costs ~25 MCU, a full video ~500 MCU.</p></div><div class=\"border-b border-gray-100 pb-6 last:border-0\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Can I upgrade or downgrade anytime?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Yes. Plan changes take effect immediately. Unused MCU credits roll over for 30 days.</p></div><div class=\"border-b border-gray-100 pb-6 last:border-0\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">What happens when I run out of MCU?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Missions queue until you top up or upgrade. You can buy MCU add-ons anytime without changing your plan.</p></div><div class=\"border-b border-gray-100 pb-6 last:border-0\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Is there a free trial?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Yes — every new account starts with 50 free MCU, enough to generate 2 proposals or 5 social bundles.</p></div><div class=\"border-b border-gray-100 pb-6 last:border-0\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Do you offer white-label or reseller pricing?</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">The Master plan includes full white-label branding. Contact us for custom reseller agreements.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 bg-orange-500 text-white text-center px-4\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-3\">Ready to automate your business?</h2><p class=\"text-orange-100 mb-6 text-lg\">Start free — 50 MCU included, no credit card needed.</p><a href=\"/login\" class=\"inline-block px-8 py-3 bg-white text-orange-600 font-bold rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition-colors text-lg\">Start Free Trial — 50 MCU</a></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-bfa919dc51912f2b.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[4845,[\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-20992096cea73e0d.js\\\"],\\\"AuthProvider\\\"]\\n3:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[8924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\nc:I[7150,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/e4af272ccee01ff0-s.p.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/c9267a044f7ad552.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"b\\\":\\\"oi3EsgSZTW9pi8W76S_GB\\\",\\\"p\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"pricing\\\"],\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"(marketing)\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"pricing\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{}]}]}]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",true],[\\\"\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/css/c9267a044f7ad552.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"html\\\",null,{\\\"lang\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"__variable_f367f3\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"body\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"antialiased\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L2\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",null,{\\\"parallelRouterKey\\\":\\\"children\\\",\\\"error\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"errorStyles\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"errorScripts\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"template\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L4\\\",null,{}],\\\"templateSt